<title>CHILE: LAN Chile nine-month net rises.</title>
<headline>LAN Chile nine-month net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airline Linea Area Nacional de  Chile SA, or LAN Chile, reported the following results for the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>				 9-mo 1996		  9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit		  9.46 profit		6.01 profit</p>
<p>Operating profit	  11.11 profit	     6.61 profit</p>
<p>Non-operating loss    687 million loss	 497 million loss</p>
<p>Total revenues		 N/A			    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>--Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
